### List jokes (newest first)
GET {{host}}/jokes?page=0&size=20

### List only programming jokes
GET {{host}}/jokes?category=PROGRAMMING

### Draw a random joke
GET {{host}}/jokes/random

### Draw a random dad joke
GET {{host}}/jokes/random?category=DAD

### Add a joke
POST {{host}}/jokes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "I would tell you a UDP joke, but you might not get it.",
  "category": "PROGRAMMING"
}

### Health
GET {{host}}/actuator/health
